\[la]//commands/zclone_archive_create/\[ra]	 - Archive source file(s) to destination.
.IP \(bu 2
zclone archive extract
\[la]//commands/zclone_archive_extract/\[ra]	 - Extract archives from source to destination.
.IP \(bu 2
