.EX
zclone cryptdecode encryptedremote: encryptedfilename1 encryptedfilename2
zclone cryptdecode --reverse encryptedremote: filename1 filename2
.EE

.PP
Another way to accomplish this is by using the \fBzclone backend encode\fR (or \fBdecode\fR)
command. See the documentation on the crypt
\[la]//crypt/\[ra] overlay for more info.

.EX
zclone cryptdecode encryptedremote: encryptedfilename [flags]
.EE

