.SH zclone deletefile
Remove a single file from remote.

.SH Synopsis
Remove a single file from remote.  Unlike \fBdelete\fR it cannot be used to
remove a directory and it doesn't obey include/exclude filters - if the
specified file exists, it will always be removed.

.EX
zclone deletefile remote:path [flags]
.EE

