.SS options/set: Set an option {#options-set}
Parameters:
.IP \(bu 2
option block name containing an object with
.RS
.IP \(bu 2
key: value
.RE

.PP
Repeated as often as required.

.PP
Only supply the options you wish to change.  If an option is unknown
it will be silently ignored.  Not all options will have an effect when
changed like this.

.PP
For example:

.PP
This sets DEBUG level logs (-vv) (these can be set by number or string)

.EX
zclone rc options/set --json '{"main": {"LogLevel": "DEBUG"}}'
zclone rc options/set --json '{"main": {"LogLevel": 8}}'
.EE

.PP
And this sets INFO level logs (-v)

.EX
zclone rc options/set --json '{"main": {"LogLevel": "INFO"}}'
.EE

.PP
And this sets NOTICE level logs (normal without -v)

.EX
zclone rc options/set --json '{"main": {"LogLevel": "NOTICE"}}'
