.SS Google Cloud Storage
GoogleCloudStorage
\[la]https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs\[ra] is an
S3-interoperable
\[la]https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs/interoperability\[ra] object
storage service from Google Cloud Platform.

.PP
To connect to Google Cloud Storage you will need an access key and secret key.
These can be retrieved by creating an HMAC key
\[la]https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs/authentication/managing\-hmackeys\[ra]\&.

.EX
[gs]
type = s3
provider = GCS
access_key_id = your_access_key
secret_access_key = your_secret_key
endpoint = https://storage.googleapis.com
.EE

.PP
\fBNote\fP that \fB--s3-versions\fR does not work with GCS when it needs to do
directory paging. Zclone will return the error:

.EX
s3 protocol error: received versions listing with IsTruncated set with no NextKeyMarker
.EE

.PP
This is Google bug #312292516
\[la]https://issuetracker.google.com/u/0/issues/312292516\[ra]\&.

