.SS Impossible Cloud {#impossible-cloud}
Impossible Cloud
\[la]https://www.impossiblecloud.com/\[ra] is a European
S3-compatible object storage provider with regions in Europe and the
US.

.PP
Note: Impossible Cloud does not preserve the \fBCache-Control\fR,
\fBContent-Disposition\fR, \fBContent-Encoding\fR or \fBContent-Language\fR system
metadata fields on retrieval, even when they were set at upload time.
Because the \fBContent-Encoding\fR response header is also dropped, the
\fB--s3-decompress\fR flag has no effect on objects stored there. Other
metadata such as \fBContent-Type\fR and the modification time round-trip
normally.

