.SS Minio
Minio
\[la]https://minio.io/\[ra] is an object storage server built for cloud application
developers and devops.

.PP
It is very easy to install and provides an S3 compatible server which can be used
by zclone.

.PP
To use it, install Minio following the instructions here
\[la]https://docs.minio.io/docs/minio\-quickstart\-guide\[ra]\&.

.PP
When it configures itself Minio will print something like this

.EX
Endpoint:  http://192.168.1.106:9000  http://172.23.0.1:9000
AccessKey: USWUXHGYZQYFYFFIT3RE
SecretKey: MOJRH0mkL1IPauahWITSVvyDrQbEEIwljvmxdq03
Region:    us-east-1
SQS ARNs:  arn:minio:sqs:us-east-1:1:redis arn:minio:sqs:us-east-1:2:redis

Browser Access:
   http://192.168.1.106:9000  http://172.23.0.1:9000

Command-line Access: https://docs.minio.io/docs/minio-client-quickstart-guide
   $ mc config host add myminio http://192.168.1.106:9000 USWUXHGYZQYFYFFIT3RE MOJRH0mkL1IPauahWITSVvyDrQbEEIwljvmxdq03

Object API (Amazon S3 compatible):
   Go:         https://docs.minio.io/docs/golang-client-quickstart-guide
   Java:       https://docs.minio.io/docs/java-client-quickstart-guide
   Python:     https://docs.minio.io/docs/python-client-quickstart-guide
   JavaScript: https://docs.minio.io/docs/javascript-client-quickstart-guide
   .NET:       https://docs.minio.io/docs/dotnet-client-quickstart-guide

Drive Capacity: 26 GiB Free, 165 GiB Total
.EE

.PP
These details need to go into \fBzclone config\fR like this.  Note that it
is important to put the region in as stated above.

.EX
env_auth> 1
access_key_id> USWUXHGYZQYFYFFIT3RE
secret_access_key> MOJRH0mkL1IPauahWITSVvyDrQbEEIwljvmxdq03
region> us-east-1
endpoint> http://192.168.1.106:9000
location_constraint>
server_side_encryption>
.EE

.PP
Which makes the config file look like this

.EX
[minio]
type = s3
provider = Minio
env_auth = false
access_key_id = USWUXHGYZQYFYFFIT3RE
secret_access_key = MOJRH0mkL1IPauahWITSVvyDrQbEEIwljvmxdq03
region = us-east-1
endpoint = http://192.168.1.106:9000
location_constraint =
server_side_encryption =
.EE

.PP
So once set up, for example, to copy files into a bucket

.EX
zclone copy /path/to/files minio:bucket
.EE

.SS Netease NOS
For Netease NOS configure as per the configurator \fBzclone config\fR
setting the provider \fBNetease\fR\&.  This will automatically set
\fBforce_path_style = false\fR which is necessary for it to run properly.

.SS Outscale
OUTSCALE Object Storage (OOS)
\[la]https://en.outscale.com/storage/outscale\-object\-storage/\[ra]
is an enterprise-grade, S3-compatible storage service provided by OUTSCALE,
