.SS Tencent COS Global Acceleration Endpoint
When using the Global Acceleration Endpoint (\fBcos.accelerate.myqcloud.com\fR),
zclone automatically sets \fBno_check_bucket = true\fR because this acceleration
endpoint does not support the \fBCreateBucket\fR call which is used for ensuring
a bucket's existence by zclone. Global Acceleration is a per-bucket feature,
so you should first create the bucket in one physical region, then enable it
in the Tencent Cloud console.

