.SS Hashes
In December 2024 \fBfiles.com\fR  started supporting more checksums
\[la]https://www.files.com/blog/2024/11/01/new\-modern\-checksum\-options\-now\-available\-with\-opt\[ra]\&.

.PP
However if you want hashes you \fBmust\fP enable them in your site by
visiting the "File Integrity" section in "Data Governance" to
configure your settings and select the checksum algorithms that meet
your requirements.

.PP
Zclone currently only support CRC32 and MD5 for use in syncing but
selecting more checksums will not affect zclone's operations.

.PP
For use with zclone, selecting at least MD5 is recommended so zclone
can do an end to end integrity check.

.PP
 

