.SS --ftp-concurrency
Maximum number of FTP simultaneous connections, 0 for unlimited.

.PP
Note that setting this is very likely to cause deadlocks so it should
be used with care.

.PP
If you are doing a sync or copy then make sure concurrency is one more
than the sum of \fB--transfers\fR and \fB--checkers\fR\&.

.PP
If you use \fB--check-first\fR then it just needs to be one more than the
maximum of \fB--checkers\fR and \fB--transfers\fR\&.

.PP
So for \fBconcurrency 3\fR you'd use \fB--checkers 2 --transfers 2
--check-first\fR or \fB--checkers 1 --transfers 1\fR\&.

