.IP \(bu 2
Type:        string
.IP \(bu 2
Required:    false

.SH Limitations
\fBzclone about\fR is not supported by the Google Cloud Storage backend. Backends without
this capability cannot determine free space for an zclone mount or
use policy \fBmfs\fR (most free space) as a member of an zclone union
remote.

.PP
See List of backends that do not support zclone about
\[la]///overview/#optional\-features\[ra]
and zclone about
\[la]///commands/zclone_about/\[ra]\&.


.SH Google Drive
Paths are specified as \fBdrive:path\fR

.PP
Drive paths may be as deep as required, e.g. \fBdrive:directory/subdirectory\fR\&.

.SH Configuration
The initial setup for drive involves getting a token from Google drive
which you need to do in your browser.  \fBzclone config\fR walks you
through it.

.PP
Here is an example of how to make a remote called \fBremote\fR\&.  First run:

.EX
zclone config
.EE

.PP
This will guide you through an interactive setup process:

.EX
