Env Var:     ZCLONE_GPHOTOS_INCLUDE_ARCHIVED
.IP \(bu 2
Type:        bool
.IP \(bu 2
Default:     false

.SS --gphotos-proxy
Use the gphotosdl proxy for downloading the full resolution images

.PP
The Google API will deliver images and video which aren't full
resolution, and/or have EXIF data missing.

.PP
However if you use the gphotosdl proxy then you can download original,
unchanged images.

.PP
This runs a headless browser in the background.

.PP
Download the software from gphotosdl
\[la]https://github.com/zclone/gphotosdl\[ra]

.PP
First run with

.EX
gphotosdl -login
.EE

.PP
Then once you have logged into google photos close the browser window
and run

.EX
gphotosdl
.EE

.PP
Then supply the parameter \fB--gphotos-proxy "http://localhost:8282"\fR to make
zclone use the proxy.

