T}	string		\fBY\fP
mtime	T{
Time when the file content was last modified (RFC 3339)
T}	RFC 3339		\fBY\fP
recycled	T{
Whether the file is in recycle bin (true/false)
T}	string		\fBY\fP
sha256	SHA256 hash of the file	string		\fBY\fP
