The initial setup for Koofr involves creating an application password for
zclone. You can do that by opening the Koofr
web application
\[la]https://app.koofr.net/app/admin/preferences/password\[ra],
giving the password a nice name like \fBzclone\fR and clicking on generate.

.PP
Here is an example of how to make a remote called \fBkoofr\fR\&.  First run:

