.IP \(bu 2
Config:      encoding
.IP \(bu 2
Env Var:     ZCLONE_AZUREBLOB_ENCODING
.IP \(bu 2
Type:        Encoding
.IP \(bu 2
Default:     Slash,BackSlash,Del,Ctl,RightPeriod,InvalidUtf8

.SS --azureblob-public-access
Public access level of a container: blob or container.

