.SH Microsoft OneDrive
Paths are specified as \fBremote:path\fR

.PP
Paths may be as deep as required, e.g. \fBremote:directory/subdirectory\fR\&.

.SH Configuration
The initial setup for OneDrive involves getting a token from
Microsoft which you need to do in your browser.  \fBzclone config\fR walks
you through it.

.PP
Here is an example of how to make a remote called \fBremote\fR\&.  First run:

.EX
