.SH Quatrix
Quatrix by Maytech is Quatrix Secure Compliant File Sharing | Maytech
\[la]https://www.maytech.net/products/quatrix\-business\[ra]\&.

.PP
Paths are specified as \fBremote:path\fR

.PP
Paths may be as deep as required, e.g., \fBremote:directory/subdirectory\fR\&.

.PP
The initial setup for Quatrix involves getting an API Key from Quatrix. You can
get the API key in the user's profile at \fBhttps://<account>/profile/api-keys\fR
or with the help of the API - 
\[la]https://docs.maytech.net/quatrix/quatrix\-api/api\-explorer#/API\-Key/post_api_key_create\[ra]\&.

.PP
See complete Swagger documentation for Quatrix
\[la]https://docs.maytech.net/quatrix/quatrix\-api/api\-explorer\[ra]\&.

.SH Configuration
Here is an example of how to make a remote called \fBremote\fR\&.  First run:

.EX
zclone config
.EE

.PP
This will guide you through an interactive setup process:

.EX
